f_T1a(x) = 3*x*(x - 1)**2*(2*x + 1)
f_T1b(x) = 3*x**2*(x - 1)**2*(x + 2)/2
f_T1c(x) = x**3*(x - 1)**2
f_T2a(x) = 3*x**2*(x - 1)**2*(x + 2)/2
f_T2b(x) = 3*x**3*(x - 1)**2/2
f_T3(x) = x**3*(x - 1)**2/2

--- Cross-check against by-hand derivations in ATTEMPT.md ---
f_T3 matches hand derivation x^3(1-x)^2/2  OK
hand_T2a = 3*x**5/2 - 9*x**3/2 + 3*x**2, code f_T2a = 3*x**5/2 - 9*x**3/2 + 3*x**2
f_T2a matches hand derivation (3/2)x^2(1-x)^2(2+x)  OK

Sum of the 6 non-T0 shape densities = 6*x**5 - 15*x**3 + 6*x**2 + 3*x

--- T0 (no cycle) ---
P_T0(m1,m2,m3) = -m1 - m2 - m3 + 1
P_T0 (brute-force 16-term sum over the T0-classified raw configs) = -m1 - m2 - m3 + 1
MATCHES the complement formula exactly -- P_T0 confirmed by two independent routes.

f_L^(T0)(ell) [density of L=m1+m2+m3 weighted by P_T0] = 3*ell**2*(1 - ell)
f_T0(x) = f_L^(T0)(1-x) = 3*x**3 - 6*x**2 + 3*x

